{"text": "When the dance finally stopped, he knocked at the door, and Shepherd Fennel, who was a kind and generous host, opened it at once. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> May I come in and rest a little while, asked the stranger politely, explaining that the rain had made the road almost impossible to walk on. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The shepherd welcomed him warmly and said that he had chosen a good night to visit, since they were celebrating a happy event in the family. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sitting by the warm fire, the stranger gladly accepted some tobacco, but he had to borrow a pipe as well, saying that he had dropped his own. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The shepherd thought it odd that a smoker should carry no pipe, but the stranger quietly lit his borrowed one and warmed himself in silence. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Soon there came a second knock, and a few moments later another man stood dripping in the doorway, asking to be let in out of the storm. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was a rather stout man, dressed in a suit of cinder gray cloth, who seemed several years older than the first stranger. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Without waiting to be invited twice, he took off his wet coat and sat down by the fire, close to the man who had come first.", "alignment": {"characters": ["W", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "a", "n", "c", "e", " ", "f", "i", "n", "a", "l", "l", "y", " ", "s", "t", "o", "p", "p", "e", "d", ",", " ", "h", "e", " ", "k", "n", "o", "c", "k", "e", "d", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "S", "h", "e", "p", "h", "e", "r", "d", " ", "F", "e", "n", "n", "e", "l", ",", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "k", "i", "n", "d", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "g", "e", "n", "e", "r", "o", "u", "s", " ", "h", "o", "s", "t", ",", " ", "o", "p", "e", "n", "e", "d", " ", "i", "t", " ", "a", "t", " ", "o", "n", "c", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "